  "zh": "# 今日最值得关注：AI 形式化验证攻克百年数学难题，地缘与金融双双剧震\n## AI 与科技\n- **Lean 验证黎曼猜想证明**：数学界首次用形式化工具全自动验证百年难题，标志 AI 辅助证明进入新纪元。\n- **OpenAI 读写二进制可执行文件**：模型能直接操作机器码，预示 AI 将深入底层软件工程。\n## 国际政治\n- **特朗普寻求与伊朗永久协议**：若成行将重塑中东地缘格局，市场密切关注油价波动。\n- **多国领导人表态一个中国原则**：外交声势升级，强化台湾问题国际共识。\n## 金融市场\n- **金价大跌超650元银行预警**：避险资产抛售潮引发投资者恐慌，短期波动或加大。\n- **顺丰速运被暂停全军采购**：合规问题引发军方供应链震动，物流龙头股价承压。\n## 产业动态\n- **比亚迪 Ti7 荷兰被禁售**：知识产权判决可能影响中国车企海外扩张节奏。\n- **胰腺癌新药获重大突破**：口服靶向药有望改写晚期胰腺癌生存曲线，临床前景备受期待。",
  "en": "# Today's top story: AI formal verification cracks century‑old math problem, geopolitics and markets both shake\n## AI & Tech\n- **Lean verifies Riemann Hypothesis proof**: First full formal verification of a 100‑year conjecture, marking a new era for AI‑assisted mathematics.\n- **OpenAI reads writes binary executables**: Models can now manipulate machine code directly, hinting at deep AI integration into low‑level software engineering.\n## Geopolitics\n- **Trump seeks permanent Iran deal**: A lasting accord would reshape Middle East geopolitics and keep oil markets on edge.\n- **Multiple leaders affirm One-China principle**: Diplomatic momentum strengthens international consensus on Taiwan.\n## Markets\n- **Gold price plunges 650 yuan banks warn**: Safe‑haven sell‑off spooks investors, likely amplifying short‑term volatility.\n- **SF Express suspended from military procurement**: Compliance issues rattle defense supply chain, pressuring logistics giant’s shares.\n## Industry\n- **BYD Ti7 banned in Netherlands**: IP ruling may slow Chinese automakers’ overseas expansion.\n- **Pancreatic cancer drug breakthrough**: Oral targeted therapy could rewrite survival for late‑stage patients, drawing intense clinical interest."
